    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Primary cushioning with 80‑GSM air‑bubble wrap:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Each fragile object—glassware, electronics, and decorative pieces—is first wrapped in a double layer of 80‑GSM heavy‑duty air‑bubble material. This high‑burst strength film absorbs shocks from road vibrations and provides a moisture barrier, a crucial feature for the monsoon‑prone journey.</p>
