      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When the final shipment arrives in Aizawl, the delivery team follows a strict, step‑by‑step protocol to guarantee that every item is intact, correctly documented, and ready for immediate use. The process starts at daylight, allowing natural light to illuminate the arrival site and provide a reliable reference for visual inspections.</p>

